config UNA_BMM350
	bool "BMM350 magnetometer"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_UNA_BMM350_ENABLED
	select I2C
	help
	  Bosch's BMM350 on I2C, asleep until a rate is asked of it. Made of
	  Zephyr's driver for the part, which turns every I2C bus over to
	  RTIO, leaves the chip measuring, and gives the field in whole
	  microtesla.
